    {
      "id": "claim_97cb9b66aab64e77b94505384ed90475",
      "statement": "Async subagents launch Agent Protocol runs in remote threads and persist task metadata in `async_tasks`; dedicated tools then check results, replace a running task's run on update, cancel it, or list refreshed status, while URL-less ASGI transport requires an async parent invocation.",
