    {
      "id": "claim_2ac080509bc24b5e90ab72765100f14f",
      "statement": "`SkillsMiddleware` discovers `SKILL.md` metadata through backend APIs, overlays same-named skills by source order, caches the resulting index in `skills_metadata` until it is set to `None`, and injects a progressive-disclosure prompt that directs the model to read full instructions on demand.",
