    {
      "id": "claim_6e7259219a4743babd7e4d33f19ec9a9",
      "statement": "Skill-selected tools are not registered in the ordinary tool node; a successful `read_file` result for a known skill's `SKILL.md` or a pinned-skill message resolves `metadata.include_tools` for a subsequent model call, and records only gated tools in `_skill_tools_disclosed`.",
